cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Fingerprint & Similarity Guide"
message: "If you use these materials, please cite them using the metadata below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Hentabli
    given-names: Hamza
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9530-2815"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hentablihamza/fingerprint-similarity-guide"
url: "https://github.com/hentablihamza/fingerprint-similarity-guide"
abstract: >
  A hands-on, 12-notebook course that benchmarks molecular fingerprints (Morgan/ECFP, FCFP,
  RDKit, atom pairs, torsions, MACCS, Avalon) and similarity metrics (Tanimoto, Dice, Cosine,
  Tversky, Russel-Rao) across four tasks - virtual screening, scaffold hopping, activity cliffs,
  and nearest-neighbour QSAR - using public data (DUD-E EGFR, ChEMBL, Delaney ESOL). Every
  number is computed from executed code. Each notebook runs in Google Colab with one click.
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - molecular fingerprints
  - similarity
  - virtual screening
  - scaffold hopping
  - QSAR
  - RDKit
  - education
  - tutorial
date-released: "2026-11-24"
